The '''Zee''' is a passive [[Mob]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Zee''' spawns when 2 {{MobSprite|Wai}}s come into contact.

== Behavior ==
'''Zees''' float in place at their spawn locations. They cannot be hit. Using a {{Item|Charminizer}} on a '''Zee''' will cause it to start following the player around. Using an {{Item|Atominizer}} on a '''Zee''' will cause it to drop a {{Item|Z}}.

